{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吳敬亭　黃夢沙　沈桐谷　王兩峯　吳載川　沈鎮山\n　沈湧思　郭繼龍　周蓮塘　葉桐君　翟春亭　戴西庚\n　姚復謙　濮兆祥　王秋白　王嘉祥　費春巖　朱秋水\n　沈仁義　葉松齋　王新盤　鄭小湖　鄭繼龍　沈琴齋\n　沈小農　趙裕坤　趙關喜　張闌泉　章小萊　方寅初\n\n　屠在椿　陳侶峯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寬夫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "萊山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方丈後軒有梁山舟侍講手書松石閒額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時與上人究堪輿之學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "堂設先外父周端書公長生位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "山陰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杏村"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師曾朝名山故云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余曾書關帝殿天地同流額"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秋白"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂懋成上人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁和"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兩峯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從兄芃澤所書寺中匾額剝蝕過半"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廬山遠公作詩換酒飲陶令"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時赴招者家秋白黃春皋章小\n萊及予四人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上人精堪輿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "李否村歿後無嗣上人擇寺中餘地葬之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "退院後擬游富春新安諸山"}
